# T97 (row I211): one local song played to its end and given a sticker through the engine. song_key.cmake then checks
# that loudness (songs.loudness_gain), history and stickers all hold the same key.
OPEN selecta-test.mod
PLAY
@render_until_end
STICKER_SET selecta-test.mod mood calm
STICKER_GET selecta-test.mod mood
STICKER_LIST selecta-test.mod
